# Morrowind Temple: Tuls Valen's "Compassion" (TT_Compassion). In the Ald'ruhn Temple Tuls Valen asks the player to
# cure the Orc Bulfim gra-Shugarz of her Ash-Chancre ("duties" names "compassion": 10, a cure blight potion). In
# Maelkashishi she lets the player try ("Ash-chancre": "I will heal you." 2, then "I offer you this potion." 4:
# RemoveSpell); BILL_TT_Bulfim_gra-Shugharz logs 50 once GetBlightDisease is 0.
# Tuls Valen thanks the player (99, a skill book), and taking the unused potion back is not offered once she drank
# it ("No. I had to use it." 2: 100).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_sevengraces_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_compassion_start
talk tuls valen
ask duties
ask compassion
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Compassion == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "p_cure_blight_s" >= 1
bye
end

case tt_compassion_cure
run
player->PositionCell 3998 4500 13579 0 "Maelkashishi, Shrine"
until 600 "bulfim_gra_shugarz"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk bulfim_gra_shugarz
ask disease
ask Ash-chancre
choose 2
choose 4
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_Compassion == 50
end

case tt_compassion_done
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask compassion
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Compassion == 99
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Compassion == 100
bye
end
